Package: cgmcalculator
Title: CGM Metric Computation, AGP Construction and Functional Data Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Yuqiong", "Li", email = "yuqiong.li01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), 
