Description: Tools for the computation of continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) metrics, 
    construction and visualization of ambulatory glucose profiles (AGP), and functional 
    data analysis of 24-hour glucose trajectories. The package provides a unified workflow 
    for transforming cleaned CGM data into standardized metrics, population- and 
    subject-level AGP summaries, and functional regression models. It supports efficient 
    processing of large-scale CGM datasets and produces publication-ready graphics and 
    reports for clinical and epidemiological research.
